{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605231043040de2d7c32a5849ed","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_9fbf78fb258745ed9cc1c776","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"D:\\loopcli\\agents\\engineering-frontend-developer\\memory\\results\\20260523_104258.md","content":"# 任务 #35 完成报告: Steam修仙工厂M5-Phase1\n\n**完成时间**: 2026-05-23 10:42:58\n**项目路径**: D:/game-projects/steam-cultivation-factory/\n\n## 完成内容\n\n### 1. Steam集成 (steamworks.js)\n- 创建 `src/main/SteamIntegration.ts` — Steam API封装模块\n  - 成就系统：39个成就映射（game ID → Steam API name）\n  - 云存档：saveToCloud / loadFromCloud 方法\n  - 优雅降级：Steam不可用时自动回退到离线模式\n  - 初始化/关闭生命周期管理\n\n### 2. Electron打包配置\n- 更新 `electron-builder.json`:\n  - NSIS安装包 + Portable便携版双输出\n  - 中文安装界面（language: 2052）\n  - steamworks.js native模块asar解包配置\n  - proper artifactName命名规范\n- 创建占位图标 `assets/icons/icon.ico`\n\n### 3. UI优化\n- **加载画面**: 粒子动画背景 + 进度条 + 阶段性加载文字\n- **主菜单**: 星空背景 + 金色主题 + 继续/新游戏/设置/退出\n- **设置页面**: 音频（主音量/音效/音乐）+ 显示（分辨率/全屏/画质/FPS）+ 存储（自动保存间隔）\n- **游戏UI美化**: 金色主题贯穿、渐变背景、发光效果、统一视觉风格\n- **工具栏增强**: 新增\"菜单\"和\"设置\"按钮\n\n### 4. 版本更新\n- package.json: 0.4.0 → 0.5.0\n- 新增依赖: steamworks.js ^0.3.1\n- 新增脚本: electron:build:win\n\n### 5. 新增模块\n- `src/main/SteamIntegration.ts` — Steam集成\n- `src/main/preload.ts` — Electron IPC桥接\n- `src/game/Settings.ts` — 游戏设置管理\n\n### 6. 更新模块\n- `src/main/main.ts` — 完整重写，集成Steam + IPC + 设置\n- `tsconfig.main.json` — 添加skipLibCheck\n- `electron-builder.json` — 完整打包配置\n- `index.html` — 全面UI升级\n\n## 技术架构\n\n```\nSteam Integration Flow:\nRenderer → preload.ts (IPC bridge) → main.ts → SteamIntegration.ts → steamworks.js → Steam API\n\nSettings Flow:\nRenderer → Settings.ts (localStorage) + electronAPI (IPC) → main.ts → app settings file\n```\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6abd1a50-ca4f-4f48-ad3d-d0b1dc08d31a","uuid":"f42f7365-fb1e-450b-b5b0-31c